From 596fd05c517099f5bc6d0d791f74246c4b150c73 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 08:47:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(session): consume one canonical status on all Desktop
 surfaces [daveey]

Preserve the recovered canonical backend reducer and make row, dot, tab,
keyboard navigation and committed-paint diagnostics consume its published
versioned status. Missing or invalid protocol is unknown, not heuristic green.
Keep activity and automated visibility observational, and preserve status through
optimistic mute updates. Declaration writes preserve newer publication revisions;
malformed controls, lost children and unreadable turn metadata fail closed.

Fresh source gates: 562 Desktop tests across 12 files, 177 Python tests across
four status/surface suites. The three retained mounted contract probes remain.
PanelModel integration is a companion mods change. Installed Mac acceptance is
not established by these source tests: all six original rows remain mandatory.

